  "structure": {
    "block_count": 67,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "What I’m Adding to My Baby Registry the Second Time Around",
        "text_sha256": "71122b1f8685bd5601ff5a846e9da2925488b4b433ab72683cd37783f33c2359",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Second Baby Registry Tips: A pregnant person opening a gift at a baby shower",
        "text_sha256": "e682dcb37fe51a3394f7013be91d4586cce0c67d2a3f6bac9a94bfe3ccf0ad90",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here’s what I regret skipping the first time and what I won’t bother with for Baby #2.",
        "text_sha256": "4c92277e78125299ecee18debe1d6730a0c27467ae20c61fc2d3896c74ded408",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Just so you know, What to Expect may earn commissions from the shopping links included on this page. All sales and prices are accurate at the time of publishing.",
        "text_sha256": "1922c3fea76d4f2a6f4ade63feb42972a2bb42e22c26d8117381d8356cd35012",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Hi all! I’m Leah, a What to Expect editor, casual-turned-professional deal hunter and mom to a 3-year-old named Olivia. I also have another baby girl on the way. Now that I’m well into my second trimester, my second baby registry is officially underway.",
        "text_sha256": "fdbcce505dcd3c9ec41555eacfac66c28631a7ebc496c326a760531399244823",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This time, I’m bringing both my editorial experience (over a decade researching and writing about baby gear) and the real-life lessons that come from surviving the newborn phase.",
        "text_sha256": "33d9e3326dd913c4ea59e264ccabe1df11173fdf41b02fb59220db24b554b4eb",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "I’ve been thinking about the sanity-saving items I bought in a panic (portable night lights were a surprise win), the so-called must-haves that collected dust (I was overly ambitious about mastering a wrap carrier) and the tried-and-true gear I used nonstop and plan to use again.",
        "text_sha256": "a4beb23bd04339837291fa0531799a58035457a2ff9a2757f60ac8235223ca8d",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here’s what I’ll be registering for before Baby #2 arrives — and what I’ve learned to skip.",
        "text_sha256": "26f7bd349bfea16bc680eeaa0184aba3f8e4d6113a408b95b75e218c77d7bf08",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby Gear Worth the Investment",
        "text_sha256": "e8d37be0c598d9729c07f090fcadc3f7f2f5562603eeaf1ebc48aff2d67d1d3e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Mockingbird Single-to-Double Stroller : Sleek, easy to maneuver and just as versatile as higher-end strollers (but at a fraction of the price).",
        "text_sha256": "8c7ac1478f32f10d35899a2d809df011f9dc600896bca7760efe57b0b659366b",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Chicco Fit360 Rotating Car Seat : This car seat works from day one through the booster stage. The rotating base was especially helpful while recovering from delivery.",
        "text_sha256": "bb197e187e5d382d88f6153b5c11b01529e9c855d486c22c37e8ed663d25b08e",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "mamaRoo Multi-Motion Baby Swing : This swing kept Olivia calm and soothed. It even earned the nickname “mamaPoo” in our house thanks to its magical effect on baby digestion.",
        "text_sha256": "663af9ed3cb768c056b082ebfd6b119cd7c05dbbc98a9c2a43b087a22d80c24e",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fisher-Price 3-in-1 Sensory Gym : A true tummy-time MVP. The six repositionable toys kept Olivia engaged through a tough milestone.",
        "text_sha256": "d3280066dde8f0fb2b0a93dbb0afc45b96b5ce248729d4a6446ff5f65a8c1b0b",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Ergobaby Mesh Baby Carrier : Comfortable, lightweight and easy to use even in those sleep-deprived early days.",
        "text_sha256": "85f60cca515533c9d95ce05273f69b924718408d437c4b14559c4a63d76dcf51",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Nursery Essentials",
        "text_sha256": "3bdafb49a68374d0ca2124da94e766a22db45464c2818f3f97bd3121e3592a1a",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The Ollie Swaddle : The only swaddle I could manage while half-asleep under dim nightlight. Simple and secure.",
        "text_sha256": "024d9bb13c6ac43eb22fb0fe2aeeb2ba2812109c23f6445a7e1f9ceb962af3ef",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Nanit Pro Baby Monitor + Floor Stand : Clear video and helpful sleep insights gave us peace of mind and helped us build a loose nap schedule.",
        "text_sha256": "aecf8e757f960cc74afdf00c1dedcae0d3b23475a3371ee9b7721493255af4cf",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Hatch Rest Sound Machine : Customizable sound and light settings that even my mom could figure out.",
        "text_sha256": "d50cd9789275a67a73a9e6099f45f44efa00a0333c1312b972b693191835a0cd",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Feeding Must-Haves",
        "text_sha256": "de95acdb132fff4678fe3d1a1405d39de10d4c54da66ac8071a96f9703c3a0af",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Nuk Simply Natural Baby Bottles : Designed to support combo feeding, with multiple holes for a natural flow and a wide neck for easier latch.",
        "text_sha256": "7537ab007eb64d2f67d71e1836fd23840f3e907ac2bd1efe3c8171cb05e3ad05",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The First Years Modular Steam Sterilizer : After many late nights boiling bottles on the stove, my mom gifted me this compact, time-saving model.",
        "text_sha256": "51ba04ceafd674894eeb95c1dfd72950312bcbed89f918f337f180ab18aa4eff",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Konny Baby Bibs : Cute enough to be worn as an outfit accessory, but super absorbent too.",
        "text_sha256": "11b5f8fc96876ef405041a5cbbe2453013b96c48d745dc383871cc91955137c6",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Comfy Cubs Muslin Burp Cloths : Soft, durable and affordable. I kept a stash in every room.",
        "text_sha256": "669a10084b709b6cb7daacb24f012768c4bf482ee70ebca1263d21cde2034173",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Boppy Nursing Pillow : This helped with positioning during breastfeeding and doubled as a tummy time support pillow.",
        "text_sha256": "edc93473835db01d087618a820b88068276ab18018fec258b2e605d1e79ea356",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "ChookaChoo Teething Mittens : Most teethers don’t stay in your baby’s hands, but these actually do.",
        "text_sha256": "6f214afd0768a19c82831c461cbf4f136681e513f09c5d5e3d5bce1f837fde01",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Changing Table MVPs",
        "text_sha256": "4a7387f118ffbad7ca9d5a0cd89a059796d73010bfa2ba7371680a54cf9674b6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "WaterWipes : A clean formula that’s gentle on sensitive skin and easy to toss in the diaper bag.",
        "text_sha256": "046f8624c0d8d57c47c3ebedc10dbb511798f88b5048aed4872b1a5afaf24f0d",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Tubby Todd All-Over Ointment : Great for diaper rash, eczema and dry skin. A little goes a long way.",
        "text_sha256": "29ec1249d1489a11fb9d7f5441e4af6cfc5f9c334e93cd2c2321a378d1e900bc",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bumco Baby Bum Brush : This silicone spatula kept my hands mess-free, especially when we were on the go.",
        "text_sha256": "0078bd3582d4c7dde8a99cbbdf016e1e194671c81d16fa3a826a8bcddcccd03f",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Oogiebear Nose and Ear Cleaner : The soft silicone loop made it easy to remove dried boogies and ear wax without a fight.",
        "text_sha256": "0c2957b0e2f6a42b5d0f08382986c272b9ac846525eea3d78a114f3b791d7e5b",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "haakaa Baby Nail File : Less nerve-wracking than clippers. The built-in light made trimming feel more precise.",
        "text_sha256": "38b5494a1ac600cd12363adc6e942739ff64eca037fa4ba52e9b6feb771b5a2c",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Bath Time Basics",
        "text_sha256": "2b63322bf19f7e2e9b1dd915ae01824a59c55ec1b75364c363ed1f4ff1df09f3",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Aveeno Baby Body Wash and Lotion : Gentle and effective, especially for Olivia’s sensitive skin. I’ve been an Aveeno fan for years.",
        "text_sha256": "ecca11accc08baff00db4edc4a3cea58198ee553ac47663fe6dae5bff07f3f85",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "KeaBabies Hooded Towels : Some of the thickest and softest towels I’ve found. They made post-bath drying quick and cozy.",
        "text_sha256": "4205bf400cd78a2a30c376936c412e4409583cb0e1db88efc0eedc642b961d68",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Frida Baby Grow-With-Me Tub : Smart design that grows with your baby and doesn’t take over the bathroom.",
        "text_sha256": "e2f4175766695297809e1ff03658152d352991c75ea9e76ad4bb876cb9213c8e",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Small (but Mighty) Sanity Savers",
        "text_sha256": "ad9884ce766f1326317a58c5dd6cb5012c4ab0a4ab6605e46f5b5ffbdc383481",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Miss Mouth’s Messy Eater Stain Treater : This miracle spray tackled every stain, from blowouts to spaghetti nights. I use it on my clothes too.",
        "text_sha256": "95bd7e127bb239c661d8c09a5ff3afc0e46554529a326b05e15db567278856fa",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Skip Hop Elbow Saver and Kneeler : Made long baths on cold tile much more bearable.",
        "text_sha256": "00aa680ba5c87ab701273bc7a369928b1fda69825cace6916f3c5a8f8316e933",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Anico EASZZZ Baby Night Light : Compact and portable with a soft glow that’s ideal for late-night feeds and changes.",
        "text_sha256": "980ad615ad63d4b4379aff51c6ea21e80006ceca3d257e8d652e352e0a219f3e",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Yogasleep Hushh Portable Sound Machine : Clips onto the stroller or crib and blocks out noise anywhere we go.",
        "text_sha256": "2e5caebf596a83070aea53f361c163078255250580af1d67b18d176a3f1f1419",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What I’m Skipping This Time",
        "text_sha256": "083a95576c53500a310f265ae592645a577c3f00fde929538ceb4321b9d3284a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Button-Up Pajamas : They’re cute, but impractical. Zippers and magnets are much easier in the middle of the night.",
        "text_sha256": "43029c0b3d27f6d8bd7f48a32321efb1913f2d0972055d653c6fd050f30d3211",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Wipe Warmers : Not worth the space, and your baby won’t mind room-temperature wipes for long.",
        "text_sha256": "4c393dc272ec325e60a70d426f390cbf2b403bfed2b9e9a8ac84a178b579ea5e",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bottle Warmers : We used a mug of warm water instead. Worked just fine.",
        "text_sha256": "70594f0c264252e4b8a534bd8dd75eb8649d82d2bc3180e2a02f4e72599db48d",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Wrap Carriers : Tried one. Got tangled. Gave up.",
        "text_sha256": "9f432cc451ef9d15ee6a093741a8aceacd9bf36f88c66dce48bb2ecac41290bc",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Too Many Toys : Babies mostly sleep, eat, and poop. A few toys for tummy time and car rides are plenty.",
        "text_sha256": "6e7161bbab583ef1983b61316625a6799acf6ca44f6e7ee89d09355f004d055f",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Final Thoughts",
        "text_sha256": "68b600e35257625a075203d67c077abd17cd76aa581e447d55d5fcb061be4f5b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Even with years of product research under my belt, I still got a few things wrong the first time. But those lessons made curating this second registry easier, smarter, and more realistic.",
        "text_sha256": "78e088d1d76b6d522bcd2aec6b225fe9a6ada6c53fcf8def5d17fd08c52b4500",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "I hope my experience helps make your registry process a little smoother too. In the end, trust your instincts — you're a mom, after all. You know what your growing family needs most.",
        "text_sha256": "f5151729813b46a6ed599e46ea8276acac3a4b08202d08ea6702ed928c352bdb",
        "word_count": 33
      },
